  "id": "gratitude",
  "term": "gratitude",
  "definition": "Gratitude is the feeling or attitude of a person who has received a favor toward the one who gave it, together with a tendency to want to do good in return. In this historical account, it is treated as a special form of benevolence and also as related to justice because the return of goodwill is seen as owed for a benefit received.",
